A '''Scrappy''' is a {{Rare}} [[Critter]] that can be found in the {{Gold|Cavern}} biome of the {{Zone|Critter Safari}}.

== Spawning ==
{{Green|3}} '''Scrappies''' spawn on the surface of the {{Gold|Cavern}} biome of the {{Zone|Critter Safari}}.

== Behavior ==
'''Scrappies''' sit on the ground while curled into a ball. Upon being fed {{Item|Wholesale Wheat}}, {{Item|Flavor-packed Fish}}, or {{Item|Lush Lily Pad}}s, they come out of their shell. The food they require is randomly chosen upon entering the {{zone|Critter Safari}}. If a {{Item|Critter Capsule}} is thrown at a '''Scrappy''' and is caught, it dies and drops its loot.

If a '''Scrappy''' escapes a {{Item|Critter Capsule}}, it attacks the player.

